Much like his game counterpart, Tierno is a dancer. Despite being a rookie , he can cope well when battling more experienced opponents thanks to his skills, teaching dance moves to his Pokémon so they can evade attacks with ease. He also battles strategically, like Sawyer, by Valuable Experience for All!.

Tierno is very friendly and is always encouraging his friends to do their best. He is very supportive of his close friends and , due to knowing them since they were little. Tierno would often watch Shauna's performances. He also has feelings for , which he demonstrates every time they meet. He was responsible for introducing Shauna to Serena. Tierno quickly befriended Sawyer and respects him as a Trainer.
